+## Context
+
+The candidate `snapshot-2026.10.04` (6,449 cases: 5,950 common, 499 added, 235 regrouped by credential-evidence) was replayed officially on credential-eval `v0.1.0-alpha.3` (CI run 37177431252, archive `official-runs-37177431252`). The adoption report `docs/generated/evidence-adoption/snapshot-2026.10.04.md` lists every difference and its cause:
+
+- **Engine effect** (alpha.1 to alpha.3, corpus fixed): none. No family, matrix entry or public case differs.
+- **Corpus effect**: 11 credential families (18 matrix entries) move from stable to provisional (116 stable, 18 provisional, 1 pending). Every reason is a methods-run gate on the added cases: 418 gate-peer differential occurrences with no review decision, and 63 metamorphic and 9 mutation failures of the reference scanner on added fragment cases of sendgrid-token. No common case contributes a new reason.
+- **Overlay effect**: the axis overlay is rebound with unchanged content, the twin-scope map becomes empty (credential-evidence now gives the six twins a family), and the review-ledger re-key is regenerated for the alpha.3 occurrence ids (4,268 of 4,268 legacy decisions map).
+- **Parity**: 0 unexplained of 42,611 compared values against the legacy oracle at the same release (@redact-secret/core 0.1.0-beta.12).
+
+## Decision
+
+OWNER TO DECIDE. If accepted: the engine pin, the vendored RunArtifact schema, the recorded runs, the regenerated overlays, the parity report and the renewed authority file in `docs/generated/evidence-adoption/snapshot-2026.10.04.acceptance.patch` become the active evidence. The public numbers move to the candidate view only through `develop` staging and then `go-production`, which the owner runs when the measurement is ready to be public. The 18 provisional matrix entries stay provisional until a reviewer settles the added cases' occurrences. Rollback is reverting the acceptance commit, or setting the authority file's `authority` back to `legacy`.
+
+## Consequences
+
+To be completed by the owner with the decision.
